From c8aceec1ae0e761a8e28be101f567a33e72898b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@local>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 04:03:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix audit issues: invisible CTA text, og:image, page titles,
 sitemap, project photos, nested sections

- globals.css: wrap base element resets in @layer base so Tailwind utilities (e.g. text-white) correctly override them. Fixes invisible white label text on all dark CTA buttons/links site-wide (header Get a Quote, hero Explore Our Work, 3D Studio CTA, FinalCTA, contact Send Enquiry, projects Start an Enquiry).
- Add public/images/seo/mauli-interior-og.jpg (1200x630) and wire it into openGraph + twitter images in root layout and homepage. Also fixes projects/sofas pages which referenced this file but it did not exist (broken og:image).
- Page titles: stop duplicating brand suffix. Subpages use short titles (template appends '| Mauli Interior'); homepage uses absolute title.
- sitemap.ts: list all 7 routes instead of only the homepage.
- projects page: replace beige placeholder blocks with real photos from the site image library (sofa, curtains, beds, furnishing).
- page.tsx: remove invalid nested <section> wrappers; aria-labels moved into FeaturedWork, WhyMauli and FinalCTA.
---
